  "name": "exostab",
  "description": "exostab reports whether the published parameters of a known multi-planet system pass three tests of dynamical stability: Hill spacing, the angular momentum deficit, and direct N-body integration with the MEGNO chaos indicator. It repeats the tests within the published uncertainties, takes its parameters from the NASA Exoplanet Archive or a file, and records every data assumption.",
